Kalau cakap tak apa, mesti jadi

00:31:13.680 --> 00:31:14.599
Cik Xu

00:31:15.319 --> 00:31:17.720
Persembahan anda agak menarik

00:31:18.519 --> 00:31:19.720
Terima kasih, Auntie Ma

00:31:21.200 --> 00:31:23.119
Episod Jamuan Keluarga seterusnya

